{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1726-p1","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《论语·先进》（《论语译注》，中华书局1980年版）。题目是编者加的。子路（前542—前480），即仲由，字子路。曾皙（生卒年不详），名点，字子皙，曾参的父亲。冉有（前522—？），即冉求，字子有。公西华（前509—？），复姓公西，名赤，字子华。四人都是孔子的弟子。侍坐，在尊长近旁陪坐。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝以吾一日长乎尔，毋吾以也〕意思是，因为我年纪比你们大一点，（你们）不要因我（年长）就不敢说话了。以，因为。后一个“以”同“已”，是“止”的意思。毋，不要。一说本句的意思是，因为我年纪比你们大一点，（老了，）没有人用我了。这里后一个“以”是“用”的意思。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝居则曰〕（你们）平日说。居，平日、平时。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝不吾知〕即“不知吾”，不了解我。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝则何以哉〕那么（你们）打算怎么做呢？","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝率尔〕急遽而不加考虑的样子。尔，相当于“然”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝千乘（shèng）之国〕有一千辆兵车的诸侯国。在春秋后期，千乘之国是中等国家。乘，古时一车四马为一乘。春秋时，一辆兵车，配甲士三人，步卒七十二人。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝摄乎大国之间〕夹在（几个）大国的中间。摄，夹处。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝加之以师旅〕有军队来攻打它。师旅，指军队。古时两千五百人为一师，五百人为一旅。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝因之以饥馑（jǐn）〕接下来又有饥荒。因，接续。饥馑，泛指饥荒。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝为之〕治理这个国家。为，治。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝比及〕等到。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝方〕合乎礼义的行事准则。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝哂（shěn）〕微笑。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝方六七十，如五六十〕纵横六七十里或五六十里（的小国）。方，计量面积用语，多用以计量土地，后加表示长度的数词或数量词，表示纵横若干长度的意思。如，或者。下文“如会同”的“如”同。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-15"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝可使足民〕可以使人民富足。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-16"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝如其礼乐，以俟君子〕至于礼乐教化，（自己的能力是不够的，）那就得等待君子（来推行了）。这是冉有的谦辞。如，至于。俟，等待。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-17"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝非曰能之，愿学焉〕不敢说我能胜任，但是愿意在这方面学习。这是公西华的谦辞。能，胜任、能做到。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-18"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝宗庙之事〕指诸侯祭祀祖先的事。在古代是国家重要的政事。宗庙，天子、诸侯供奉祖宗牌位的处所。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-19"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝会同〕古代诸侯朝见天子的通称。会，诸侯在非规定时间朝见天子。同，诸侯一起朝见天子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-20"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝端章甫〕穿着礼服，戴着礼帽。这是做小相（xiàng）时的穿戴。端，古代的一种礼服。章甫，古代的一种礼帽。端和章甫在这里都用作动词。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-21"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝相〕诸侯祭祀、会盟或朝见天子时，主持赞礼的司仪官。所谓“小相”，也是公西华的谦辞。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-22"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝鼓瑟希〕弹奏瑟的声音（渐渐）稀疏，指接近尾声。希，同“稀”，稀疏。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-23"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝铿（kēng）尔〕铿的一声，指止瑟声。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-24"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝舍瑟而作〕把瑟放下，站起来。作，起身、站起来。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-25"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝撰〕才能。这里指为政的才能。一说，讲述、解说。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-26"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝何伤〕何妨。意思是有什么关系呢。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-27"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝莫（mù）春〕即暮春，农历三月。莫，同“暮”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-28"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝春服既成〕春天的衣服已经穿定了。意思是天气渐暖，不必频繁换衣。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-29"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝冠（guàn）者〕成年人。古代男子在二十岁时行加冠礼，表示成年。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-30"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝童子〕少年，未成年的男子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-31"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝沂（yí）〕水名，在今山东曲阜南。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-32"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝风乎舞雩（yú）〕在舞雩台上吹吹风。风，吹风。舞雩，台名，是鲁国求雨的坛，在今曲阜南。雩，求雨的祭祀仪式，伴以乐舞，故称“舞雩”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-33"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝咏〕唱歌。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-34"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝喟（kuì）然〕叹息的样子。喟，叹息。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-35"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝与〕赞成。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-36"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝也已矣〕语气助词连用，相当于“罢了”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-37"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝为国以礼，其言不让〕治国要用礼，（可是）他（仲由）的话毫不谦逊。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-38"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝唯求则非邦也与〕难道冉求讲的不是国家的事吗？唯，语气助词，用于句首，无实义。邦，国。也与，语气助词，表示疑问。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-39"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝安见〕怎见得。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-40"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝宗庙会同，非诸侯而何〕宗庙祭祀、朝见天子，不是诸侯国的事又是什么呢？意思是，公西赤说的也是国家大事，不过讲得谦虚罢了。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-41"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"﹝赤也为之小，孰能为之大〕如果公西赤只能给诸侯做一个小相，那么谁能做大相呢？","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11170-42"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"子路、曾皙、冉有、公西华侍坐","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11170-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"\n\n《论语》\n\n子路、曾皙、冉有、公西华侍坐。\n\n子曰：“以吾一日长乎尔，毋吾以也","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11170-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。居则曰","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11170-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"：‘不吾知","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11170-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"也！’如或知尔，则何以哉","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-11170-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"？”\n\n子路率尔","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-11170-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"而对曰：“千乘之国","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-11170-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，摄乎大国之间","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-11170-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，加之以师旅","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-11170-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，因之以饥馑","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-11170-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"；由也为之","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-11170-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，比及","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-11170-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"三年，可使有勇，且知方","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-11170-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"也。”\n\n夫子哂","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-11170-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之。\n\n“求！尔何如？”\n\n对曰：“方六七十，如五六十","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-11170-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，求也为之，比及三年，可使足民","type":"text"},{"label":"[16]","noteId":"footnote-11170-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。如其礼乐，以俟君子","type":"text"},{"label":"[17]","noteId":"footnote-11170-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。”\n\n“赤！尔何如？”\n\n对曰：“非曰能之，愿学焉","type":"text"},{"label":"[18]","noteId":"footnote-11170-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。宗庙之事","type":"text"},{"label":"[19]","noteId":"footnote-11170-19","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，如会同","type":"text"},{"label":"[20]","noteId":"footnote-11170-20","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，端章甫","type":"text"},{"label":"[21]","noteId":"footnote-11170-21","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，愿为小相","type":"text"},{"label":"[22]","noteId":"footnote-11170-22","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"焉。”\n\n“点！尔何如？”\n\n鼓瑟希","type":"text"},{"label":"[23]","noteId":"footnote-11170-23","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，铿尔","type":"text"},{"label":"[24]","noteId":"footnote-11170-24","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，舍瑟而作","type":"text"},{"label":"[25]","noteId":"footnote-11170-25","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，对曰：“异乎三子者之撰","type":"text"},{"label":"[26]","noteId":"footnote-11170-26","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。”\n\n子曰：“何伤","type":"text"},{"label":"[27]","noteId":"footnote-11170-27","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"乎？亦各言其志也。”\n\n曰：“莫春","type":"text"},{"label":"[28]","noteId":"footnote-11170-28","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"者，春服既成","type":"text"},{"label":"[29]","noteId":"footnote-11170-29","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，冠者","type":"text"},{"label":"[30]","noteId":"footnote-11170-30","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"五六人，童子","type":"text"},{"label":"[31]","noteId":"footnote-11170-31","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"六七人，浴乎沂","type":"text"},{"label":"[32]","noteId":"footnote-11170-32","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，风乎舞雩","type":"text"},{"label":"[33]","noteId":"footnote-11170-33","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，咏","type":"text"},{"label":"[34]","noteId":"footnote-11170-34","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"而归。”\n\n夫子喟然","type":"text"},{"label":"[35]","noteId":"footnote-11170-35","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"叹曰：“吾与","type":"text"},{"label":"[36]","noteId":"footnote-11170-36","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"点也！”\n\n三子者出，曾皙后。曾皙曰：“夫三子者之言何如？”\n\n子曰：“亦各言其志也已矣","type":"text"},{"label":"[37]","noteId":"footnote-11170-37","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。”\n\n曰：“夫子何哂由也？”\n\n曰：“为国以礼，其言不让","type":"text"},{"label":"[38]","noteId":"footnote-11170-38","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，是故哂之。”\n\n“唯求则非邦也与","type":"text"},{"label":"[39]","noteId":"footnote-11170-39","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"？”\n\n“安见","type":"text"},{"label":"[40]","noteId":"footnote-11170-40","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"方六七十如五六十而非邦也者？”\n\n“唯赤则非邦也与？”\n\n“宗庙会同，非诸侯而何","type":"text"},{"label":"[41]","noteId":"footnote-11170-41","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"？赤也为之小，孰能为之大","type":"text"},{"label":"[42]","noteId":"footnote-11170-42","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"？”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"宋刘氏天香书院刻本《论语》书影","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":391286,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/e/ecc854fcb9bf22a95fb3b194271ed0d6702fc1a5.jpeg","height":721,"id":"media-a7285cd667d819eba560","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"16a03c77c0d8e2bc83490dd1797a7ad331311594619a8cbb772d761d5076241f","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/e/ecc854fcb9bf22a95fb3b194271ed0d6702fc1a5.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":938}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11170-1","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11170-1","postId":"11170-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11170-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11170-2","postId":"11170-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11170-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11170-3","postId":"11170-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11170-3","